sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant R as Runner/Worker
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant OS as Object Storage
    participant WF as Temporal Workflow
    participant RC as Reconciler

    R->>DB: renew attempt + slot lease generation
    R->>OS: write checkpoint payload atomically
    OS-->>R: object URI + SHA-256
    R->>DB: insert checkpoint + side-effect receipts
    R->>DB: append monotonic checkpoint event
    Note over R,DB: process crashes or connection is lost
    DB-->>RC: expired lease detected
    RC->>DB: state=UNKNOWN_RESULT then RECONCILING
    RC->>DB: inspect receipts, event watermark, checkpoint
    RC->>OS: verify object digest and availability
    alt side effect completed
        RC->>DB: mark node/task completed idempotently
    else resumable from checkpoint
        RC->>WF: signal/update resume from checkpoint
        WF->>R: start new attempt with new generation
    else ambiguous
        RC->>DB: state=MANUAL_RECOVERY
    end
